# Explicit protected control --env-file input: serve and dataset initialize/verify/export/import commands. No ambient environment authority.
# YAML must be independently valid; supplied keys override YAML, omitted keys retain YAML/DefaultDatasetPolicy.
# All fields are nonsecret policy values; restart applies changes without rebuilding.
# Cross-field constraints remain enforced by DatasetPolicy.Validate; see datasets-policy.md.

# Purpose/owner: runtime.datasets.snapshot_maximum_files; integer count.
# Optional override; DefaultDatasetPolicy default 10000; permitted 1..100000 plus typed relations.
